  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1202.09 Commercial discharge permit (CDP)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1202.09 “Commercial discharge permit (CDP)” means a regulatory document issued by the WRBP designed to control the discharge of pollutants from commercial users into the public sewer as authorized in RSA 485-A:45-54.\n\nSource. #8235, eff 12-22-04 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1200) (formerly Env-Ws 1202.09); ss by #9798-A, eff 10-9-10; ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
